(Policy Objectives) Tj
0 -14 Td
(-----------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Digital policy aims to improve connectivity, digital service delivery, inclusion, innovation) Tj
0 -14 Td
(and access to government services. Digital public infrastructure can provide common) Tj
0 -14 Td
(foundations used by multiple programmes.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Digital Service Delivery) Tj
0 -14 Td
(------------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Government portals and digital platforms can reduce paperwork and make services easier to) Tj
0 -14 Td
(access. myScheme, for example, is designed as a platform that helps citizens discover) Tj
0 -14 Td
(government schemes across categories.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Digital Public Infrastructure) Tj
0 -14 Td
(-----------------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Shared digital systems can support identity, payments, document exchange and service) Tj
0 -14 Td
(delivery. Their value increases when institutions can build services using common standards) Tj
0 -14 Td
(and trusted interfaces.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Financial and Social Services) Tj
0 -14 Td
(-----------------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Digital platforms can support benefit delivery, banking access, pension services and other) Tj
0 -14 Td
(citizen-facing programmes. Direct benefit delivery requires accurate beneficiary information) Tj
0 -14 Td
(and effective mechanisms for resolving errors.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Connectivity and Inclusion) Tj
0 -14 Td
(--------------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Digital services depend on connectivity, devices and digital skills. Policy must therefore) Tj
0 -14 Td
(consider rural connectivity, affordability, accessibility and language diversity, rather) Tj
0 -14 Td
(than assuming that all citizens have equal access.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Governance Challenges) Tj
0 -14 Td
(---------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Digital governance must balance convenience with cybersecurity, privacy, reliability and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(accountability. Large public systems need clear rules for access, data handling, grievance) Tj
0 -14 Td
(redressal and continuity during outages.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Service Status and Inclusion) Tj
0 -14 Td
(----------------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(An application submitted, an application authenticated, a request approved and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(a service successfully delivered are different statuses. Authentication failure) Tj
0 -14 Td
(can result from incorrect records rather than ineligibility, while a successful) Tj
0 -14 Td
(approval may still be delayed by a bank, department or local service provider.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Dashboard totals can also use different update times. Digital access should be) Tj
0 -14 Td
(measured with attention to assisted-service use, failed transactions, language) Tj
0 -14 Td
(support, accessibility and outage duration, not only the number of registered) Tj
0 -14 Td
ET
